{"ref":"BDB, סִיסְרָא","hw":"סִיסְרָא","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">סִיסְרָא</span></big><sub>21</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>GFM <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:2\" href=\"/Judges.4.2\">Ju 4:2</a>; <sup>PAOS xix (1898), 160</sup> cp. Hittite names in <em>-sira</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  general of Jabin, king of Hazor <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:2\" href=\"/Judges.4.2\">Ju 4:2</a> + 12 times <a data-ref=\"Judges 4\" href=\"/Judges.4\">Ju 4</a>; appar. himself king <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:20\" href=\"/Judges.5.20\">5:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:26\" href=\"/Judges.5.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:28\" href=\"/Judges.5.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:30\" href=\"/Judges.5.30\">30</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.9\">1 S 12:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:10\" href=\"/Psalms.83.10\">ψ 83:10</a>;—on <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> v. GFM Ju, 107 ff.; <sup>PAOS l.c.;</sup> 𝔊 Σ(ε)ισαρα.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי־סִיסְרָא</span>, returned exiles, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:53\" href=\"/Ezra.2.53\">Ezr 2:53</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:54\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.54\">Ne 7:55</a>; 𝔊 Σεισαραθ, Σισαρα, etc.","next":"BDB, סִיעָא","prev":"BDB, סִיס"}